{
  "_README": [
    "HAND-AUTHORED supplement for terms CIG's own localization files do NOT cover.",
    "These are community/meta terms that appear constantly in guide writing but",
    "never appear as an in-game string, so build_glossary.py cannot find them.",
    "",
    "STATUS: authored, NOT verified against native-speaker community usage.",
    "Everything here should be reviewed by someone who reads the German/French/",
    "Japanese/Chinese SC communities before it is trusted. It is applied AFTER",
    "the CIG glossary, so it never overrides an official CIG translation.",
    "",
    "'keep' means: leave this term in English in that language. For DE and FR",
    "especially, the community routinely uses the English term verbatim, and",
    "translating it makes the text read like a machine wrote it."
